PW SCF of H2O (15 A box) with real-space spin constraint (becke weights, delta mode, +0.1 uB on O, nspin=2): reference phase mu=0 -> m_ref(O)=5.9e-6, constrained phase mu -> -0.07234 Ry, outer step 3 CONVERGED, CONSTRAINT_AUDIT q=0.09998 t=0.100006 maxdev=2.2e-16. The split injection (V_up += mu*w, V_dn -= mu*w) drives m = rho_up - rho_dn with a NEGATIVE response (dQ/dmu ~ -1.38 e/Ry, measured), so the converged mu for a positive moment delta is negative (same sign pattern as the charge channel).
